  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU public diplomacy in Uzbekistan in 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: EU public diplomacy in Uzbekistan in 2024 - The Action will support all the three MIP objectives, i.e. (i) effective governance and digital transformation; (ii) inclusive, digital and green growth; (iii) development of a smart eco-friendly agri-food sector, through promotion of EU visibility actions.&amp;nbsp;Strategic communication activities of EU Uzbekistan will focus on the above-mentioned MIP priorities. We will involve leaders, opinion makers, successful youth, inspiring stories of empowerment leading to change and showcasing the value of personal engagement EU Uzbekistan plans to undertake a wide range of activities to achieve its communication goals. Those events include, but are not limited to cultivating and expanding already well-established and positive diplomatic relationships between the management of the EU Delegation and the policy makers in Uzbekistan, as well as cultivating positive reputation and open, approachable public image of the EUD management among the media.&amp;nbsp;That will be done through participation, leading presence and speeches at various events by the EU Delegation, open interaction with media, journalists and bloggers at national and regional level, press conferences and breakfasts with local journalists. The importance of cultivating closer relationships with social, economic bloggers that have an influence on educated, intellectual and expert part of the population will become more integral.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
